                              text "Initially code-named \"Wilbur\"," 48 10375 204 16 serif 16
                              text "[" 252 10378 7 13 serif 13 underline link 411
                              text "18" 259 10378 9 13 serif 13 underline link 411
                              text "]" 268 10378 7 13 serif 13 underline link 411
                              text " HTML 3.2 dropped math formulas entirely, reconciled overlap among various" 275 10375 496 16 serif 16
                            line 48 10393 744 20 base 14
