                            text ".) These included extensions to control stylistic aspects of documents, contrary to the \"belief [of the" 80 11698 656 16 serif 16
                          line 48 11716 744 20 base 14
                            text "academic engineering community] that such things as text color, background texture, font size, and font face were" 48 11718 744 16 serif 16
                          line 48 11736 744 20 base 14
                            text "definitely outside the scope of a language when their only intent was to specify how a document would be" 48 11738 692 16 serif 16
                          line 48 11756 744 20 base 14
