                            text "Although its syntax closely resembles that of " 48 12086 296 16 serif 16
                            text "SGML" 344 12086 36 16 serif 16 underline link 472
                            text ", " 380 12086 8 16 serif 16
                            text "HTML5" 388 12086 44 16 serif 16 underline link 473
                            text " has abandoned any attempt to be an SGML application" 432 12086 356 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12104 744 20 base 14
