                        block dd 48 12164 744 120
                          line 48 12164 744 20 base 14
                            text "On 14 February 2011, the W3C extended the charter of its HTML Working Group with clear milestones for HTML5. In" 48 12166 724 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12184 744 20 base 14
                            text "May 2011, the working group advanced HTML5 to \"Last Call\", an invitation to communities inside and outside W3C" 48 12186 736 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12204 744 20 base 14
                            text "to confirm the technical soundness of the specification. The W3C developed a comprehensive test suite to achieve" 48 12206 744 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12224 744 20 base 14
                            span span 704 12228 7 13
                            span span 720 12228 7 13
                            span span 704 12228 23 13
                            span a 704 12228 23 13 link 475
                            span sup 704 12228 23 13
                            text "broad interoperability for the full specification by 2014, which was the target date for recommendation." 48 12226 656 16 serif 16
                            text "[" 704 12228 7 13 serif 13 underline link 475
                            text "51" 711 12228 9 13 serif 13 underline link 475
                            text "]" 720 12228 7 13 serif 13 underline link 475
                            text " In" 727 12226 20 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12244 744 20 base 14
                            text "January 2011, the WHATWG renamed its \"HTML5\" living standard to \"HTML\". The W3C nevertheless continued its" 48 12246 724 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12264 744 20 base 14
                            span span 212 12268 7 13
                            span span 232 12268 6 13
                            span span 212 12268 26 13
                            span a 212 12268 26 13 link 476
                            span sup 212 12268 26 13
                            text "project to release HTML5." 48 12266 164 16 serif 16
                            text "[" 212 12268 7 13 serif 13 underline link 476
                            text "52" 219 12268 13 13 serif 13 underline link 476
                            text "]" 232 12268 6 13 serif 13 underline link 476
