                          span code 632 14039 24 16
                          span span 756 14039 16 16
                          span span 772 14039 8 16
                          span span 780 14039 8 16
                          span code 756 14039 32 16
                          text "In the simple, general case, the extent of an element is indicated by a pair of tags: a \"start tag\" " 8 14039 624 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 632 14039 8 16 mono 16
                          text "p" 640 14039 8 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 648 14039 8 16 mono 16
                          text " and \"end tag\" " 656 14039 100 16 serif 16
                          text "</" 756 14039 16 16 mono 16
                          text "p" 772 14039 8 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 780 14039 8 16 mono 16
                          text "." 788 14039 4 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14057 784 20 base 14
                          text "The text content of the element, if any, is placed between these tags." 8 14059 448 16 serif 16
                      block p 8 14093 784 40
                        line 8 14093 784 20 base 14
                          text "Tags may also enclose further tag markup between the start and end, including a mixture of tags and text. This indicates" 8 14095 780 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14113 784 20 base 14
                          text "further (nested) elements, as children of the parent element." 8 14115 392 16 serif 16
                      block p 8 14149 784 80
                        line 8 14149 784 20 base 14
                          span i 300 14151 60 16
                          text "The start tag may also include the element's " 8 14151 292 16 serif 16
                          text "attributes" 300 14151 60 16 serif 16 italic
                          text " within the tag. These indicate other information, such as" 360 14151 368 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14169 784 20 base 14
                          text "identifiers for sections within the document, identifiers used to bind style information to the presentation of the document," 8 14171 784 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14189 784 20 base 14
                          span span 208 14191 8 16
                          span span 216 14191 24 16
                          span span 240 14191 8 16
                          span code 208 14191 40 16
                          text "and for some tags such as the " 8 14191 200 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 208 14191 8 16 mono 16
                          text "img" 216 14191 24 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 240 14191 8 16 mono 16
                          text " used to embed images, the reference to the image resource in the format like this:" 248 14191 532 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14209 784 20 base 14
                          span span 8 14211 8 16
                          span span 16 14211 24 16
                          span span 48 14211 24 16
                          span span 72 14211 8 16
                          span span 80 14211 200 16
                          span span 280 14211 8 16
                          span code 8 14211 280 16
                          text "<" 8 14211 8 16 mono 16
                          text "img" 16 14211 24 16 mono 16
                          text " " 40 14211 8 16 mono 16
                          text "src" 48 14211 24 16 mono 16
                          text "=" 72 14211 8 16 mono 16
                          text "\"example.com/example.jpg\"" 80 14211 200 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 280 14211 8 16 mono 16
                      block p 8 14245 784 40
