                              span code 76 16500 16 16
                              text "The " 48 16500 28 16 serif 16
                              text "id" 76 16500 16 16 mono 16
                              text " attribute provides a document-wide unique identifier for an element. This is used to identify the element so" 92 16500 696 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16518 744 20 base 14
                              text "that stylesheets can alter its presentational properties, and scripts may alter, animate or delete its contents or" 48 16520 708 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16538 744 20 base 14
                              text "presentation. Appended to the URL of the page, it provides a globally unique identifier for the element, typically a" 48 16540 724 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16558 744 20 base 14
                              text "sub-section of the page. For example, the ID \"Attributes\" in" 48 16560 388 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16578 744 20 base 14
                              span span 48 16580 360 16
                              span code 48 16580 360 16
                              text "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTML#Attributes" 48 16580 360 16 mono 16
