                              span span 720 16620 8 16
                              span span 728 16620 8 16
                              span code 592 16620 144 16
                              text "purposes. For example, an HTML document might semantically use the designation " 48 16620 544 16 serif 16
                              text "<" 592 16620 8 16 mono 16
                              text "class" 600 16620 40 16 mono 16
                              text "=\"" 640 16620 16 16 mono 16
                              text "notation" 656 16620 64 16 mono 16
