                              text ">" 728 16620 8 16 mono 16
                              text " to" 736 16620 16 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16638 744 20 base 14
                              text "indicate that all elements with this class value are subordinate to the main text of the document. In presentation" 48 16640 728 16 serif 16
                              text "," 776 16640 4 16 serif 16
