                        span a 350 23650 29 13 link 659
                        span sup 350 23650 29 13
                        text "The WYSIWYG editing model has been criticized," 8 23648 316 16 serif 16
                        text "[" 324 23650 7 13 serif 13 underline link 658
                        text "99" 331 23650 13 13 serif 13 underline link 658
                        text "]" 344 23650 6 13 serif 13 underline link 658
