                        span a 720 23670 26 13 link 661
                        span sup 720 23670 26 13
                        text "there are various developers advocating a change to the " 8 23668 368 16 serif 16
                        text "WYSIWYM" 376 23668 68 16 serif 16 underline link 660
                        text " model (" 444 23668 56 16 serif 16
                        text "what you see is what you mean" 500 23668 208 16 serif 16 italic
                        text ")." 708 23668 12 16 serif 16
                        text "[" 720 23670 7 13 serif 13 underline link 661
                        text "101" 727 23670 13 13 serif 13 underline link 661
                        text "]" 740 23670 6 13 serif 13 underline link 661
                    block p 8 23702 784 20
                      line 8 23702 784 20 base 14
                        text "WYSIWYG editors remain a controversial topic because of their perceived flaws such as:" 8 23704 572 16 serif 16
                    block ul 8 23738 784 160
                      block li 48 23738 744 40
                        line 48 23738 744 20 base 14
                          text "Relying mainly on the layout as opposed to meaning, often using markup that does not convey the intended" 48 23740 696 16 serif 16
                        line 48 23758 744 20 base 14
                          span span 296 23762 7 13
                          span span 319 23762 6 13
                          span span 296 23762 29 13
                          span a 296 23762 29 13 link 662
                          span sup 296 23762 29 13
                          text "meaning but simply copies the layout." 48 23760 248 16 serif 16
                          text "[" 296 23762 7 13 serif 13 underline link 662
                          text "102" 303 23762 16 13 serif 13 underline link 662
                          text "]" 319 23762 6 13 serif 13 underline link 662
                        marker "• " 36 23740 12 16
                      block li 48 23778 744 40
                        line 48 23778 744 20 base 14
                          text "Often producing extremely verbose and redundant code that fails to make use of the cascading nature of HTML and" 48 23780 740 16 serif 16
                        line 48 23798 744 20 base 14
                          span a 48 23800 24 16 link 663
                          text "CSS" 48 23800 24 16 serif 16 underline link 663
                          text "." 72 23800 4 16 serif 16
