                          span span 692 23820 8 16
                          span span 700 23820 16 16
                          span span 716 23820 8 16
                          span code 692 23820 32 16
                          text "Often producing ungrammatical markup, called " 48 23820 304 16 serif 16
                          text "tag soup" 352 23820 56 16 serif 16 underline link 664
                          text " or semantically incorrect markup (such as " 408 23820 284 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 692 23820 8 16 mono 16
